    "m2_prompt_trader_proposal_original": "**Action**: Hold\n\n**Reasoning**: The evidence is genuinely balanced and does not support either a decisive buy or sell. The bull case rests on strong verified fundamentals ($62.6B operating cash flow, fortress balance sheet, price above all key moving averages, RSI at 63.96 still bullish) and a valid uptrend. However, the bear case is equally grounded: MACD histogram collapsed 87.6% ($1.85 to $0.23), RSI rolled over from 74.13, the stock has failed at $190.53 resistance three times on declining volume (relative volume 0.58), and price is 8.1% extended above the 50 SMA. Critically, news, sentiment, and macro data are all UNAVAILABLE, so we are flying blind on catalysts. The risk/reward at $188.19 is not asymmetric in the bull's favor \u2014 downside to the 50 SMA is ~7.5% vs. upside to the Bollinger upper of only ~4.4%. Per the plan, I maintain existing positions, do not add at $188.19, and wait for either a confirmed breakout above $190.53 on strong volume or a pullback to the $182-185 zone for a better entry. A SELL is not warranted given the strong fundamentals and absence of any negative catalyst evidence.\n\n**Entry Price**: 190.53\n\n**Stop Loss**: 182.07\n\n**Position Sizing**: Maintain moderate weight; do not add new exposure at $188.19. For existing holders, tighten stops to just below the $182.07 Bollinger middle band / 50 SMA zone.\n\nFINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL: **HOLD**",
